info.thermaladd.singularCrucible=Melts on the TE Magma Crucible's recipes, three lines at once, into a shared 100,000 mB tank.
info.thermaladd.singularTransposer=Fills and empties on the TE Fluid Transposer's recipes, three lines at once, around a shared 100,000 mB tank.
info.thermaladd.tip.fluidOutput=Pipes take the fluid from sides set to "Output (Fluid)" or "All"; with the Auto-Output augment the machine pushes it out itself.
info.thermaladd.tip.wrenchFluid=Wrench: click to rotate, sneak + right-click to dismantle, keeping augments, settings, energy and the tank's fluid.
info.thermaladd.tip.transposerMode=The button switches the whole machine between filling (tank into items) and extracting (items into the tank).
info.thermaladd.tip.transposerContainers=Portable tanks and other fluid containers are filled and emptied gradually, one per line.
